-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
14. ORIGINAL WORK ATTRIBUTION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project (CinemaSystem-CSharp) is a complete rewrite in C# and .NET 10
based on the original CinemaSystem project written in C++.

The C# implementation introduces:
  - A new architecture (Clean Architecture with 5 layers)
  - New design patterns (Repository, Strategy, Facade, Adapter)
  - New domain modeling (Rich Domain Model with Encapsulation)
  - New dependency management (Dependency Injection)

The C++ version served as:
  - Functional inspiration
  - Domain reference (business rules, entities, workflows)
  - Team collaboration foundation

All C# code, architecture, file structure, naming conventions, comments,
and documentation in this repository are original work by the primary author,
unless otherwise credited.

